<title>USA: Quick &amp; Reilly to split stock three-for-two.</title>
<headline>Quick &amp; Reilly to split stock three-for-two.</headline>
<dateline>PALM BEACH, Fla 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Quick &amp; Reilly Group Inc said Tuesday its board of directors had approved a three-for-two split of its common stock.  </p>
<p>The company said the split will be payable March 25 to stockholders of record March 4, bringing the total amount of shares outstanding to about 37.8 million.</p>
<p>The Quick &amp; Reilly Group is the corporate parent of Quick &amp; Reilly Inc,  who are discount brokers.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
